{"3371740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AUM The Game", "steam_appid": 3371740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In AUM, you don’t kill your opponent. You break them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most fighting games end when a health bar hits zero. AUM ends when your enemy’s will to fight does. Stamina is the real battlefield — drain it through combat pressure, elemental mastery, and psychological dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️<strong>TRINITY COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fighter is built on three pillars: <strong>Body, Mind, and Spirit</strong>. Your combination determines how you fight — brute force, tactical control, or something no one’s prepared for. With 75+ unique build combinations, your fighter is yours alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥<strong>FIVE ELEMENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ether. Air. Fire. Water. Earth.</strong> Each element feeds into the next in a cycle. Learn the chain, and you control the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍<strong>14 REALMS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mythological worlds where each realm changes how you fight and evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE WORLD REMEMBERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic Karma system tracks your actions and changes the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT’S IN THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Real-time PvP arenas<br>• Trinity combat system<br>• Five elemental combat styles<br>• 75+ build combinations<br>• Character customization<br>• Dynamic Karma system<br>• 14 unique realms<br>• Free-to-play — no pay-to-win<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted 